title: 《我们为什么吃（太多）》图3 节食与改变环境信号路径对比
tags: [[读书笔记]] [[常青笔记]] [[全书框架]] [[节食]] [[环境信号]] [[实操]] [[图示]]
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

同一个目标「想减重」，两条路径的四步因果对比：左侧低热量节食从链条末端硬拉体重，右侧改上游环境信号。对应 [[《我们为什么吃（太多）》全书框架与因果逻辑]] 第五节。

<svg viewBox="0 0 680 480" width="100%" style="max-width:680px;height:auto" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <title>低热量节食与改变环境信号两条减重路径的因果对比</title> <desc>左侧节食路径依次触发饥荒判定、代谢下降与饥饿反扑、反弹超调、代谢永久受损，结果越减越胖；右侧改变环境信号路径通过稳胰岛素、睡眠、换油脂、运动与降血糖负荷，让大脑主动下调定点。</desc> <defs> <marker id="arrow3" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"> <path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/> </marker> </defs> <rect x="240" y="40" width="200" height="44" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#5F5E5A" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="340" y="62" font-size="14" font-weight="500" fill="#2C2C2A" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central">想减重</text> <path d="M290 84 L290 96 L180 96 L180 106" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <path d="M390 84 L390 96 L500 96 L500 106" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <rect x="40" y="108" width="280" height="36" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <rect x="40" y="108" width="3" height="36" fill="#A32D2D"/> <text x="56" y="126" font-size="14" font-weight="500" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">路径 A · 低热量节食（失败）</text> <rect x="360" y="108" width="280" height="36" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <rect x="360" y="108" width="3" height="36" fill="#0F6E56"/> <text x="376" y="126" font-size="14" font-weight="500" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">路径 B · 改变环境信号（有效）</text> <rect x="40" y="152" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="58" y="176" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">1　热量缺口 → 大脑判定饥荒</text> <rect x="360" y="152" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="378" y="176" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">1　稳胰岛素：高脂蛋白早餐、戒零食</text> <path d="M180 200 L180 214" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <path d="M500 200 L500 214" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <rect x="40" y="216" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="58" y="240" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">2　代谢下降 ＋ 饥饿反扑</text> <rect x="360" y="216" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="378" y="240" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">2　睡眠与褪黑素、降低皮质醇</text> <path d="M180 264 L180 278" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <path d="M500 264 L500 278" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <rect x="40" y="280" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="58" y="304" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">3　反弹超调、定点被上调</text> <rect x="360" y="280" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="378" y="304" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">3　换传统油脂、恢复欧米伽比例</text> <path d="M180 328 L180 342" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <path d="M500 328 L500 342" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <rect x="40" y="344" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="58" y="368" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">4　反复节食 → 代谢永久受损</text> <rect x="360" y="344" width="280" height="48" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <text x="378" y="368" font-size="13" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">4　短时运动 ＋ 循序渐进降 GL</text> <path d="M180 392 L180 406" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <path d="M500 392 L500 406" fill="none" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#arrow3)"/> <rect x="40" y="408" width="280" height="52" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#A32D2D" stroke-width="0.5"/> <rect x="40" y="408" width="3" height="52" fill="#A32D2D"/> <text x="56" y="434" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">结果：越减越胖、代谢更差</text> <rect x="360" y="408" width="280" height="52" rx="8" fill="#F7F7F5" stroke="#0F6E56" stroke-width="0.5"/> <rect x="360" y="408" width="3" height="52" fill="#0F6E56"/> <text x="376" y="434" font-size="13" font-weight="500" fill="#2C2C2A" dominant-baseline="central">结果：大脑主动下调定点</text> </svg>

''读图：'' 路径 A 每一步都在向系统报「饥荒」，最终被拉回并超调；路径 B 让大脑主动下调定点，具体做法见 [[降低体重定点的第一步是重塑高脂低碳水的饱腹饮食]] 起的 5 步执行手册。

